  "ruleText": "Fam 604.03 Duration of the Basic Course. The basic course shall be at least 48 hours, excluding any assigned or voluntary supplementary reading.\n\nSource. #9087, eff 2-16-08; ss by #9675, eff 4-2-10; ss by #12507, INTERIM, eff 4-2-18, EXPIRED: 10-1-18\n\nNew. #12637, eff 10-2-18",
